  1→# live-verdict-screenshot-check - Implementation Report v1
       2→
       3→## Summary
       4→
       5→This sub-feature adds E2E screenshot capability for the snake game to prevent test misjudgment due to infrastructure timeouts and to provide visual proof of game functionality in PRs.
       6→
       7→## Changes Made
       8→
       9→### New Files Created
      10→
      11→| File | Description |
      12→|------|-------------|
      13→| `snake/screenshots/.gitkeep` | Placeholder to version-control the screenshots directory |
      14→| `snake/scripts/e2e-screenshot.sh` | E2E screenshot generation script using `script` command |
      15→| `snake/scripts/asciinema.sh` | Alternative E2E recording script using asciinema |
      16→
      17→## Verification
      18→
      19→### Build & Test Results
      20→
      21→```
      22→cd snake && go build ./...      ✓ PASSED
      23→cd snake && go vet ./...        ✓ PASSED
