       3→## Summary
       4→
       5→This sub-feature adds E2E screenshot capability for the snake game to prevent test misjudgment due to infrastructure timeouts and to provide visual proof of game functionality in PRs. The implementation uses event-driven input handling without background goroutines.
       6→
       7→## Context
       8→
       9→**Inherits from v2/v3**:
      10→- v2: Original architecture - Go + termbox-go, ASCII borders, 20x20 grid
      11→- v3: Code review fixes - data race (mutex/waitgroup), rand.Seed moved to reset()
