      74→| `snake/scripts/asciinema.sh` | Alternative E2E recording using asciinema |
      75→
      76→### No Go Code Changes Required
      77→
      78→The v4 plan described fixes for:
      79→- **CRITICAL - Input goroutine not restarting**: Already resolved - no goroutine exists
